00:59:31,578 --> 00:59:37,578
Catfish is a 2010 American documentary film directed
by Henry Joost and Ariel Schulman.

14
01:04:06,315 --> 01:04:12,315
It involves a young man, Nev, being filmed by his brother and friend, co-directors Ariel and Henry, as he
builds a romantic relationship with a young woman on the social networking website Facebook.

15
01:08:41,052 --> 01:08:47,052
The film was a critical and commercial success.

16
